  "question": {
    "text": "The root mean square speed of molecules of nitrogen gas at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is approximately: (Given mass of a nitrogen molecule <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>26</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> and take Boltzmann constant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> )",
